mfreadwrite: forward transform GPU samples while preserving upload and output backpressure.

Cider-Topic: media/mf
Source: Highball0010 / ValveSoftware wine 164af86d (CW-Bug-Id 20833).
Rebase: Wine 11.18 7b3fff76. Retain native/software upload and shared queue
ownership. Forward only a transform D3D11 texture satisfying sharing flags.
Probe retained output before new source input; complete real pool errors,
preserve queued-response order/EOS output, and actually discard processor
input on Flush. Nondefault candidate; actual runtime/GPU acceptance pending.

